  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>It is a hydrolysis&nbsp;reaction. In this reaction first cyclo hexane cyanide forms cyclohexyl methanamide which on further hydrolysis forms cyclohexyl methanoic&nbsp;acid. In this reaction water behaves as nucleophile and attacks on electrophilic site of carbonyl group.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0128_57d81f7fb12b.png\" style=\"width: 387px; height: 268px;\" /></p>"
